<section class="prose">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    Urban Exposed is a record of the places time forgot — hospitals,
    factories, homes, and everything in between, documented before they're
    gone for good.
  </p>
  <p>
    Access is arranged with property owners and site managers wherever
    possible, not improvised at a fence line. It's slower, but it's the
    only way to do this work honestly.
  </p>
  <p>
    Thanks for looking.
  </p>
</section>
